{"id": "EUVD-2026-107539", "enisaUuid": "a98d85a4-86da-3c84-8999-745b84ee8632", "description": "A vulnerability was identified in leomoon-studios wiki-go up to 1.9.1. This impacts an unknown function of the file internal/handlers/metadata_api.go of the component fetch-metadata Endpoint. Such manipulation leads to server-side request forgery. It is possible to launch the attack remotely. The exploit is publicly available and might be used. Upgrading to version 1.9.2 will fix this issue. The name of the patch is 25498ebf5c012b870967e38eec2a1e5133fa1a83. Upgrading the affected component is recommended.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T19:30:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T19:30:14", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P", "references": ["https://vuldb.com/vuln/424731", "https://vuldb.com/vuln/424731/cti", "https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-114374", "https://vuldb.com/submit/1019388", "https://github.com/leomoon-studios/wiki-go/security/advisories/GHSA-7q4p-98g4-pwp7", "https://github.com/leomoon-studios/wiki-go/commit/25498ebf5c012b870967e38eec2a1e5133fa1a83", "https://github.com/leomoon-studios/wiki-go/releases/tag/v1.9.2", "https://github.com/leomoon-studios/wiki-go/"], "aliases": ["GHSA-p8fx-449f-qx64", "CVE-2026-114374"], "assigner": "VulDB", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8abc74dc-08af-389d-a3e5-ea1811d7aa72", "product": {"name": "wiki-go", "vendor": {"name": "leomoon-studios"}}, "product_version": "1.9.0"}, {"id": "962ac516-bc2c-3119-a2e8-80bf439b4a03", "product": {"name": "wiki-go", "vendor": {"name": "leomoon-studios"}}, "product_version": "1.9.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bc8e9bb1-faf6-3d1c-afb6-3967bd57a2c6", "vendor": {"name": "leomoon-studios"}}], "isExploited": false}